This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/validate-fixture-hygiene.sh (and the shard-stub resolver it calls,
scripts/validate-fixture-invocations.sh), which live in the repo-root scripts/ and are never installed. The
validator is a pre-suite step of the distribution's .githooks/pre-push only; on a consumer neither program exists,
so this fixture could resolve no subject there.
